{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Veblen Finance LLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilise cutting edge <strong><i>CrockChain</i></strong> technology to generate a fortune in <strong><i>FliptoCurrency!</i></strong>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spin, Nudge and Strike to mine coins. Upgrade your rig to mine even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>**all fortunes generated remain the property of Veblen Finance LLC</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632060/extras/ByteCoin.png?t=1744121501\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632060/extras/LightCoin.png?t=1744121501\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632060/extras/DoggoCoin.png?t=1744121501\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632060/extras/Mysterium.png?t=1744121501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flipto is a rogue-like slot-machine-builder, where you can customise every aspect of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 10 starting loadouts that alter the way runs play out.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 10 available roles from Intern to CEO, each more difficult than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200+ tokens that grant a wide range of static effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 150 mods to apply to the slots on your rig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades to the number of actions and inventory slots available to you that last the whole run, as well as extra unlockable lines to score on.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632060?t=1744121501","background_raw":"https:/